//  ccwrap llibcxx03: <string> for Open Watcom. llibcxx03 owns the whole
//  exception + string stack, so this is a self-contained basic_string with the
//  libc++ SMALL STRING OPTIMIZATION: a string of up to sizeof(__long)-2 chars
//  (sizeof(void*)*3 - 2, i.e. 10 on 32-bit) lives inline in the object with no
//  allocation; longer strings switch to a heap buffer. char_traits + allocator.
